{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1306770-how-do-i-feed-twenty-rank-four-spirits","id":1306770,"title":"How do I feed twenty, rank four spirits?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-22T00:14:08-07:00","id":1306770,"title":"How do I feed twenty, rank four spirits?","content":"Hey there everyone! Just hoping on as a Storyteller to ask everyone here how my NPC Thyrsus Spirit Mage can keep her 20, rank 4 Spirits fed with the following Arcanum: <br /> Death 1, Fate 2, Forces 2, Life 3, Spirit 4<br /> <br /> In addition, what would the repercussions be if she were to do this your way?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24459-hemo_liadon","name":"Hemo_Liadon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24459_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T04:58:04-07:00","id":1306799,"title":"","content":"Thats a lot of very powerful spirits. My first question is what kind of spirit are they? And why arent they feeding themselves in the usual ways?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6230-katana1515","name":"Katana1515","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T07:01:31-07:00","id":1306835,"title":"","content":"Yeah, Spirits that powerful are in charge of spirit courts of their own, they should already have enough Essence to sustain themselves. What I think a Mage would do is be in a position to provide them surplus Essence beyond what they normally can acquire on their own from their minions, or to provide other services.<br /> <br /> Like, they're not dogs, they're either kings in their own right and you're the emperor, or they're kings who treat you like an independent contractor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T10:25:06-07:00","id":1306890,"title":"","content":"Agreed, as a fellow &quot;pet hoarder&quot;, I have to warn you that those spirits should probably kill or enslave you. If you can even keep a few of them fed they'll want to boss you around. It sounds like you are gnosis 3 or at best 4. So you are considered Rank 3 or 4 to them. 3 is terrible. 4 means they'd still disparage you as an outsider and may enslave you as a pet or kill you as a threat.<br /> Depending on the spirits of course... theres a lot more details that could change all this.<br /> <br /> BUT, assuming that the spirits influences compel them to be, ah, &quot;helpful&quot; to you, or you modified them to be loyal, or if a rank 5 spirit made a deal with you to enforce your will over them, or ANYTHING really that justifies them wanting to negotiate with you instead of enslaving you....<br /> <br /> Then look no further than mass mass *mass* use of Create Fetish! In 1e its optional effect was a separate spell called medicine bag. Exploit this to gain &quot;gruel&quot; for your spirit allies. As an ST I'd even allow flavoring it by letting it ferment at resonant locations that exude the flavor you need.<br /> <br /> But again honestly you need to be rank 5 or allied with a rank 5 spirit to boss these things around. I love spirits and love interacting with them but they're single-minded practically sociopathic aliens that put themselves first and OCD on their essence needs and their bans and banes. You can't train them to stop acting like that. It sucks that you have to bully them around a bit, but thats how the Shadow works and spirits *expect* it of their lords. You need a way to control these things other than providing food. If yoj provide food they'll see you as a pantry to be fought over and *taken*, not an ally to trade with.<br /> <br /> You need Spirit 5 and Gnosis 5 to boss them around. That honorary rank 5 will go a long way. But still, 20 of them... and they won't be stupid either at that high a rank!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7967-scarlet-witch","name":"Scarlet Witch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"498"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T10:50:12-07:00","id":1306899,"title":"","content":"Remember to keep your spirits free range instead of simply free run.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T18:56:02-07:00","id":1307097,"title":"","content":"To clarify to everyone, the Spirits have been changed and empowered from a series of rank 2 spirits by a couple of Combined spells. Other then that Sparrow has Gnosis 4 and has transformed them from what they were into Spirits of &quot;Sparrow's Guardian Sparrow&quot;. If this is something that still shouldn't work out, the Cabals of the city will be having a fun time for the next little while. :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24459-hemo_liadon","name":"Hemo_Liadon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24459_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T19:33:26-07:00","id":1307105,"title":"","content":"It works fine, but that means they get their Essence off guarding Sparrow and enslaving all the other local spirits they can to do the same so they can collect a tithe of Essence. Since there\u2019s 20 of them they\u2019ll compete against each other violently and cause a significant disruption in the Shadow. So yes, the local cabals will be having \u201cfun.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T19:36:53-07:00","id":1307107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1306770-how-do-i-feed-twenty-rank-four-spirits?p=1307105#post1307105\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It works fine, but that means they get their Essence off guarding Sparrow and enslaving all the other local spirits they can to do the same so they can collect a tithe of Essence. Since there\u2019s 20 of them they\u2019ll compete against each other violently and cause a significant disruption in the Shadow. So yes, the local cabals will be having \u201cfun.\u201d</div> </div> </div> </div>Rapid and unexpected environmental upheavals with resultant power struggles between existing and invasive food-web-cult-kingdoms are my idea of a great date night!<br /> <br /> Said no one remotely involved with the Shadow ever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T19:43:11-07:00","id":1307111,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hemo_Liadon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1306770-how-do-i-feed-twenty-rank-four-spirits?p=1307097#post1307097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spirits of &quot;Sparrow's Guardian Sparrow&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's where they get their Essence. They have to guard him from something. Fortunately as Rank 4 spirits they can strongarm minor spirits and drive non-ephemerals into helping out the cause.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, you can use Channel Essence to gather Essence and feed them (spirits need 1 Essence per day to stay active in the Shadow, and lose 1 Essence per hour in the physical world). Or you can make a locus, somehow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-22-2019, 11:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T22:36:04-07:00","id":1307146,"title":"","content":"Well then, thank you all for the help in understanding Spirit. It is the Arcanum that I understand the least. :P I'll probely have to reduce the number by a bit to be honest as my players have not enciuntered her yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24459-hemo_liadon","name":"Hemo_Liadon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24459_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T22:57:59-07:00","id":1307152,"title":"","content":"I would reduce it by a lot. Five at most.<br /> <br /> Like, four rank 3's are already a hell of a challenge for most play groups, even mages, and even Spirit mages are going to struggling against the reins of that. Five Barons are...a hell of a game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 04-23-2019, 02:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-22T23:51:25-07:00","id":1307159,"title":"","content":"Since no one has mentioned it (directly):<br /> <br /> Rank 3 spirits are little gods and Rank 4 spirits are an order of magnitude more powerful; even a single Rank 4 spirit suddenly being added to the spirit eco-system is a major disaster - think Category 5 hurricane disaster.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-23T00:36:04-07:00","id":1307164,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1306770-how-do-i-feed-twenty-rank-four-spirits?p=1307159#post1307159\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since no one has mentioned it (directly):<br /> <br /> Rank 3 spirits are little gods and Rank 4 spirits are an order of magnitude more powerful; even a single Rank 4 spirit suddenly being added to the spirit eco-system is a major disaster - think Category 5 hurricane disaster.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, Spirit magic normally can't manage the feat of raising a spirit's Rank twice; Sparrow has either made or started with a batch of lesser Jagglings, and the latter is substantially harder to swing without extensive legwork.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-23T08:28:52-07:00","id":1307226,"title":"","content":"It would also be 20 medium acts of hubris, under 'Forcing a sapient being (whether a Sleeper, spirit, or anything else) to act counter to its interests, altering its nature long-term, or binding it to a task all risk degeneration.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-23T10:23:10-07:00","id":1307245,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1306770-how-do-i-feed-twenty-rank-four-spirits?p=1307226#post1307226\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would also be 20 medium acts of hubris, under 'Forcing a sapient being (whether a Sleeper, spirit, or anything else) to act counter to its interests, altering its nature long-term, or binding it to a task all risk degeneration.'</div> </div> </div> </div>Or just one. Advance Scale factor. Probably modified to a lower rating, though. Or perhaps the mage is inured to using that spell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-23T10:31:08-07:00","id":1307246,"title":"","content":"Isn't the whole barganing chip a Fate conditional duration on the Rank boosting spell ? It would say something like &quot;If you act against me or my cabal through direct or indirect means, through action or inaction, through lies or omission then the spell ends&quot;. Quite literally it says you made them powerful and you can take that power away, your interests are their interests now, because otherwise they will be weakened amidst a pack of jackals that will not let them rise to power again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-23-2019, 01:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-23T12:10:24-07:00","id":1307272,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1306770-how-do-i-feed-twenty-rank-four-spirits?p=1307246#post1307246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't the whole barganing chip a Fate conditional duration on the Rank boosting spell ? It would say something like &quot;If you act against me or my cabal through direct or indirect means, through action or inaction, through lies or omission then the spell ends&quot;. Quite literally it says you made them powerful and you can take that power away, your interests are their interests now, because otherwise they will be weakened amidst a pack of jackals that will not let them rise to power again.</div> </div> </div> </div>So it's Game of Thrones instead of a blood bath.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> You know what I mean.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T13:12:06-07:00","id":1307565,"title":"","content":"So, all things said, it would be better to raise only maybe four rank two spirits into four, rank three spirits and call it and act of Hubris?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24459-hemo_liadon","name":"Hemo_Liadon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24459_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T13:19:32-07:00","id":1307569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hemo_Liadon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1306770-how-do-i-feed-twenty-rank-four-spirits?p=1307565#post1307565\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, all things said, it would be better to raise only maybe four rank two spirits into four, rank three spirits and call it and act of Hubris?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah. That's definitely more manageable and still has a lot of fun baked in.<br /> <br /> (Rank 3 anything tend to be the movers and shakers of any of the ephemeral entities, and four makes for potent drama without being drastically overpowered for any of the parties involved.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T13:34:49-07:00","id":1307572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hemo_Liadon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1306770-how-do-i-feed-twenty-rank-four-spirits?p=1307565#post1307565\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, all things said, it would be better to raise only maybe four rank two spirits into four, rank three spirits and call it and act of Hubris?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds good. Remember that its technically only an Act of Hubris if the caster doesn't convince the spirits to be willingly transformed. Such as &quot;I transform you to do this job for me and you will get a Rank boost while doing it , you are free to do whatever you with that power on your free time, so long as it doesn't affect me negatively&quot;. Then you add the Fate conditional duration to be safe. That should cover the Wisdom and tactical risks to your mage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T14:28:28-07:00","id":1307586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1306770-how-do-i-feed-twenty-rank-four-spirits?p=1307572#post1307572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That should cover the Wisdom and tactical risks to your mage.</div> </div> </div> </div>It should cover the forcing-another-being-AoH, but it sounds extremely Unwise granting extra power to spirits without any kind of accountability as long as it doesn't affect you personally. I'd very much recommend for the ST to show the consequences of upsetting the local spirit hierarchy in that way. Especially if any of the spirits usually hunt for Essence in critical locales like hospitals, courthouses or media offices; places where a shift in process effectivity (treatments or diseases), decision making (trials) or even bias (for political coverage) can have big effects when the spirit starts flinging Influences around to produce more Essence of its own liking.<br /> And remember that even seemingly benign spirits can cause disruption and damage when trying to secure sources of Essence, like a spirit of healing making sure there always are enough people who need to be healed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T14:42:55-07:00","id":1307588,"title":"","content":"Well yes, that is a given, spirits are beings of extremes. Those measures should cover immediate AoHs, but whether the situation escalates into something that causes more or worse potential instances depends on how much followup he gives the whole situation and how well he adapts to monkey wrenches in his plans. Which probably means its just a matter of time, no plan survives contact with the players intact.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T14:57:49-07:00","id":1307592,"title":"","content":"Is there anything wrong with loving spirits? My old ST kept getting upset that I enjoy spirits even if they're dangerous. I feel like they're not TOO alien but my STs opinion was that if the players don't feel confused and terrified of spirits no matter how experienced you are, the ST has failed to make them &quot;alien&quot;.<br /> <br /> But I don't see why. Spirits make sense to me, is that wrong or bad playing if I feel like I can understand their motivations?<br /> <br /> They'res a lot of nuance sure but, Spirits aren't *that* complicated are they? They just seek to maximize their survival and their essence hoarding, and seem to me classic simplified examples of the Rules to Rule By.<br /> <br /> I haven't had a chance to play it out exactly but my motivation as a player is usually to become involved in spiritual hierarchies and gain my own court... Much like the character for whom this thread discusses.<br /> <br /> Is that a guaranteed issue? My old ST thought something like that should only be allowed if you are a Seer of the Throne...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7967-scarlet-witch","name":"Scarlet Witch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"498"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T15:16:51-07:00","id":1307596,"title":"","content":"I agree, spirits are awesome. They are a living picture of the emotional panorama of an area, they are ideas that seek to grow, to spread. They are beings that evolve as their ideas prosper, growing in power, skill and Intelligence to heights that are worrying to humanity. They are at once predator, prey and parasite, living in a complex mixture of the food chain and politics.<br /> <br /> Yet they are also alien, with a different perspective, priorities and instincts to humans. They are not social beings, they are predators. But there are just enough intersections for humans to understand them, enough power to tempt, enough rope for any mortal to hang themselves with when they are incorporated into the ecosystem.<br /> <br /> They are beings of extremes, some better at donning the masque of civility than others, some more alien their peers. A hospital spirit will look more bizarre than the spirits of monuments, for example. But all of them are obsessive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-24-2019, 06:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T15:19:21-07:00","id":1307597,"title":"","content":"I think your old ST should put that energy into making Abyssal entities more &quot;alien&quot;.<br /> <br /> The &quot;issue&quot; I see with that motivation is that it'll easily make the mage slide into Unwise behaviour, but that's certainly not something the Seers have monopoly on.<br /> The other actual issue is that it might be a solo venture in a cooperative game. Other players might not be interested (or even capable since players tend to avoid the Spirit Arcanum completely if they have no interest in spirits and the Shadow) and then you draw time and attention away from group activities if you attempt to pursue that during sessions. Not applicable in solo games, though, or if the entire group wants to much around with spirits, and not even a problem in more common groups if the ST is okay with having solo sessions on the side for side activities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T15:29:53-07:00","id":1307600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1306770-how-do-i-feed-twenty-rank-four-spirits?p=1307111#post1307111\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's where they get their Essence. They have to guard him from something. Fortunately as Rank 4 spirits they can strongarm minor spirits and drive non-ephemerals into helping out the cause.</div> </div> </div> </div>Read: Sparrow should expect a lot of &quot;random&quot; encounters in her life for her entourage to conveniently be there to protect her from. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T19:30:18-07:00","id":1307658,"title":"","content":"Thank you everyone for the amazing help! I've always been a little nervous posting on forums because many of them are pretty unwelcoming... So, thank you all for your help with my first question on the Forum!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24459-hemo_liadon","name":"Hemo_Liadon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24459_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-26T16:42:19-07:00","id":1308171,"title":"","content":"Why the hell would she need 20 spirits? Even if they started as rank 2 I kinda think the correct answer is to let them wreak havoc. She clearly hasn't considered how difficult it is to keep pets if she has that many of them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13691-margul","name":"Margul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}